msgid "环境变量与编译选项"
msgstr "Environment Variables and Compiler Options"

msgid "本文汇总 Triton-Ascend 中可由开发者显式控制的行为开关，包括运行前设置的环境变量，以及编译期通过 `triton.Config` 或 kernel launch meta-parameter 传入的 NPU 编译选项。"
msgstr "This document summarizes the behavior switches in Triton-Ascend that can be explicitly controlled by developers, including environment variables set before runtime, and NPU compilation options passed in during the compilation phase via `triton.Config` or kernel launch meta-parameters."

msgid "环境变量"
msgstr "Environment variable"

msgid "环境变量用法示例"
msgstr "Environment Variable Usage Examples"

msgid "环境变量需在运行 Python 程序前设置，例如："
msgstr "Environment variables must be set before running the Python program, for example:"

msgid "export TRITON_DEBUG=1\\n"
msgstr "export TRITON_DEBUG=1"

msgid "环境变量参考表"
msgstr "Environment Variable Reference Table"

msgid "环境变量配置参考下表："
msgstr "Environment variable configuration reference table below:"

msgid "类别"
msgstr "Category"

msgid "默认值"
msgstr "Default value"

msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Functional Description"

msgid "配置说明"
msgstr "Configuration Notes"

msgid "变更声明"
msgstr "Change Declaration"

msgid "**调试与日志**"
msgstr "**Debugging and Logging**"

msgid "TRITON_DEBUG"
msgstr "TRITON_DEBUG"

msgid "0 或未设置"
msgstr "0 or not set"

msgid "启用 Triton 的调试输出功能，用于在运行时打印详细的调试信息。这对于排查编译或执行阶段的问题非常有用。 当设置为 1 时，Triton 会输出更多关于编译过程、内核生成和执行的信息。 某些实现中可能支持更细粒度的调试级别（如 2, 3 等），具体取决于 Triton 的版本和实现。"
msgstr "Enable Triton's debug output functionality to print detailed debug information at runtime. This is very useful for troubleshooting issues during the compilation or execution phases. When set to 1, Triton will output more information about the compilation process, kernel generation, and execution. Some implementations may support finer-grained debug levels (such as 2, 3, etc.), depending on the version and implementation of Triton."

msgid "0：不启用DEBUG<br>1：启用DEBUG"
msgstr "0: DEBUG disabled<br>1: DEBUG enabled"

msgid "<br>"
msgstr "<br>"

msgid "MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP"
msgstr "MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP"

msgid "在每次 MLIR 优化前转储所有内核的 IR。使用 `MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=kernelName`可以只转储特定内核的IR。"
msgstr "Dump the IR of all kernels before each MLIR optimization. Use `MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=kernelName` to dump the IR of a specific kernel only."

msgid "0：不转储<br>1：转储所有内核IR kernelName：转储特定内核IR"
msgstr "0: Do not dump<br>1: Dump all kernel IR<br>kernelName: Dump IR for a specific kernel"

msgid "Triton 缓存可能干扰转储。如果 `MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=1`  不生效，可尝试清理 Triton 缓存： `rm -r ~/.triton/cache`"
msgstr "Triton cache may interfere with dumping. If `MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=1` does not take effect, try clearing the Triton cache: `rm -r ~/.triton/cache`"

msgid "LLVM_IR_ENABLE_DUMP"
msgstr "LLVM_IR_ENABLE_DUMP"

msgid "在每次 LLVM IR 优化前转储 IR。"
msgstr "Dump IR before each LLVM IR optimization."

msgid "0：不转储<br>1：转储IR"
msgstr "0: Do not dump<br>1: Dump IR"

msgid "TRITON_REPRODUCER_PATH"
msgstr "TRITON_REPRODUCER_PATH"

msgid "未设置"
msgstr "Not set"

msgid "在每个 MLIR 编译阶段前生成 MLIR 复现文件。如果某阶段失败，`<reproducer_path>`  将保存失败前的 MLIR 状态。"
msgstr "Generate MLIR reproducer files before each MLIR compilation phase. If a phase fails, `<reproducer_path>` will save the MLIR state before the failure."

msgid "<reproducer_path>：保存路径"
msgstr "<reproducer_path>: Save path"

msgid "TRITON_INTERPRET"
msgstr "TRITON_INTERPRET"

msgid "使用 Triton 解释器而非 GPU 运行，支持在核函数代码中插入 Python 断点"
msgstr "Run using the Triton interpreter instead of the GPU, supporting the insertion of Python breakpoints in kernel function code."

msgid "0：不支持断点<br>1：支持断点"
msgstr "0: Breakpoints not supported<br>1: Breakpoints supported"

msgid "TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG"
msgstr "TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG"

msgid "向LLVM 传递`-debug`参数，输出大量调试信息。若信息过多，可使用`TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY`限制输出范围。"
msgstr "Pass the `-debug` argument to LLVM to output a large amount of debugging information. If there is too much information, you can use `TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY` to limit the output scope."

msgid "0：不传递<br>1：传递"
msgstr "0: Do not pass<br>1: Pass"

msgid "另一种减少输出干扰的方法是：先设置 `LLVM_IR_ENABLE_DUMP=1`运行程序，提取目标LLVM优化通道前的中间表示（IR），然后单独运行LLVM的`opt`工具，此时可通过命令行添加`-debug-only=foo`参数来限定调试范围。"
msgstr "Another way to reduce output noise is to first set `LLVM_IR_ENABLE_DUMP=1` and run the program to extract the intermediate representation (IR) before the target LLVM optimization pass, then run LLVM's `opt` tool separately, where you can add the `-debug-only=foo` parameter on the command line to limit the debugging scope."

msgid "TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY"
msgstr "TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY"

msgid "功能等同于 LLVM 的`-debug-only`命令行选项。该参数可将 LLVM 调试输出限定到特定的优化通道或组件名称（这些名称通过 LLVM 和 Triton 中的`#define DEBUG_TYPE`宏定义），从而有效减少调试信息的冗余输出。用户可指定一个或多个逗号分隔的值，例如：`TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY=\"tritongpu-remove-layout-conversions\"`或`TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY=\"tritongpu-remove-layout-conversions,regalloc\"`。"
msgstr "Functionally equivalent to LLVM's `-debug-only` command-line option. This parameter restricts LLVM debug output to specific optimization passes or component names (defined via the `#define DEBUG_TYPE` macro in LLVM and Triton), effectively reducing redundant debug information output. Users can specify one or more comma-separated values, for example: `TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY=\"tritongpu-remove-layout-conversions\"` or `TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY=\"tritongpu-remove-layout-conversions,regalloc\"`."

msgid "逗号分隔值：通道或组件名称"
msgstr "Comma-separated values: channel or component names"

msgid "USE_IR_LOC"
msgstr "USE_IR_LOC"

msgid "控制是否在生成的中间表示（IR）中包含位置信息（如文件名、行号等）。这些信息对调试很有帮助，但可能会增加生成的IR的大小。设置为1，会重新解析中间表示(IR)，将位置信息映射为具有特定扩展名的IR文件行号（而非Python源文件行号）。这能建立从IR到LLVM IR/PTX的直接映射关系。配合性能分析工具使用时，可实现对IR指令的细粒度性能剖析。"
msgstr "Control whether to include location information (such as file names, line numbers, etc.) in the generated intermediate representation (IR). This information is helpful for debugging but may increase the size of the generated IR. When set to 1, the intermediate representation (IR) will be re-parsed, mapping location information to line numbers of IR files with a specific extension (rather than Python source file line numbers). This establishes a direct mapping from IR to LLVM IR/PTX. When used with performance analysis tools, it enables fine-grained performance profiling of IR instructions."

msgid "0：不包含位置信息<br>1：包含位置信息"
msgstr "0: Does not include location information<br>1: Includes location information"

msgid "TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO"
msgstr "TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO"

msgid "true"
msgstr "true"

msgid "控制是否在`bishengir-compile`命令中追加`--enable-debug-info=true`，即是否在生成的内核可执行文件中包含行号等调试信息。**注意**：triton-ascend 默认值为`true`（默认**关闭**行号信息，与社区 Triton 默认开启相反）。行号信息可用于定位精度/性能问题及 profiling 分析，但会增加编译产物大小。"
msgstr "Controls whether to append `--enable-debug-info=true` to the `bishengir-compile` command, that is, whether to include line numbers and other debug information in the generated kernel executable. **Note**: The default value for triton-ascend is `true` (line number information is **disabled** by default, which is the opposite of the community Triton default where it is enabled). Line number information can be used to locate precision/performance issues and for profiling analysis, but it increases the size of compilation artifacts."

msgid "0/false：启用行号信息<br>1/true：禁用行号信息"
msgstr "0/false: Enable line number information<br>1/true: Disable line number information"

msgid "配合性能分析使用时，请参考[算子性能调优方法](./debug_guide/profiling.md)。"
msgstr "For use with performance profiling, refer to [Operator Performance Tuning Methods](./debug_guide/profiling.md)."

msgid "TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING"
msgstr "TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING"

msgid "在自动调优完成后，输出每个内核的最佳配置及总耗时。"
msgstr "After auto-tuning is complete, output the best configuration and total time for each kernel."

msgid "0：不输出<br>1：输出"
msgstr "0: No output<br>1: Output"

msgid "MLIR_ENABLE_REMARK"
msgstr "MLIR_ENABLE_REMARK"

msgid "启用MLIR 编译过程中的备注信息输出，包括以备注形式输出的性能警告。"
msgstr "Enable MLIR compilation remark output, including performance warnings output in the form of remarks."

msgid "0：不启用<br>1：启用"
msgstr "0: Disabled<br>1: Enabled"

msgid "TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP"
msgstr "TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP"

msgid "启用或禁用 Triton 内核的转储功能，当启用时，Triton 会将生成的内核代码（各编译阶段IR及最终PTX）保存到指定目录。"
msgstr "Enable or disable the dump functionality for Triton kernels. When enabled, Triton will save the generated kernel code (IR at each compilation stage and the final PTX) to the specified directory."

msgid "TRITON_DUMP_DIR"
msgstr "TRITON_DUMP_DIR"

msgid "~/.triton/dump"
msgstr "~/.triton/dump"

msgid "指定 Triton 内核转储文件的保存目录。当`TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP=1`时保存IR和PTX的目录。"
msgstr "Specifies the save directory for Triton kernel dump files. When `TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP=1`, this is the directory where IR and PTX are saved."

msgid "\"path\"：保存路径"
msgstr "\"path\": Save path"

msgid "TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT"
msgstr "TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT"

msgid "当设置为`1` 或者 `true`时（`TRUE` 将被转换为 `true`），启用`tl.device_print`功能。 重要说明：该功能使用GM缓冲区（其指针被传递给内核）。"
msgstr "When set to `1` or `true` (`TRUE` will be converted to `true`), the `tl.device_print` feature is enabled. Important note: this feature uses the GM buffer (whose pointer is passed to the kernel)."

msgid "0：不启动<br>1：启用`tl.device_print`功能"
msgstr "0: Disabled<br>1: Enable the `tl.device_print` feature"

msgid "每个线程的GM缓冲区最大为16KB，超限内容将被丢弃。该值目前固定，后续将通过环境变量调整。"
msgstr "The maximum GM buffer per thread is 16KB, and content exceeding this limit will be discarded. This value is currently fixed and will be adjustable via environment variables in the future."

msgid "TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY"
msgstr "TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY"

msgid "控制是否生成内存使用情况的 json 文件。当`TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY=1`时保存 memory_info_aic/aiv.json 文件到当前目录 。"
msgstr "Controls whether to generate a JSON file for memory usage. When `TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY=1`, save the memory_info_aic/aiv.json file to the current directory."

msgid "**编译控制**"
msgstr "**Compilation Control**"

msgid "TRITON_ALWAYS_COMPILE"
msgstr "TRITON_ALWAYS_COMPILE"

msgid "控制 Triton 是否每次运行都强制重新编译内核，而不是使用已有的缓存版本。 默认情况下，Triton 会对已经编译过的内核进行缓存（基于参数和配置），以提高性能。 设置为 1 后，Triton 将忽略缓存并每次都重新编译内核，这在调试或测试新编译器特性时非常有用。"
msgstr "Controls whether Triton forces recompilation of kernels on every run instead of using cached versions. By default, Triton caches already-compiled kernels (based on parameters and configuration) to improve performance. When set to 1, Triton ignores the cache and recompiles kernels every time, which is useful for debugging or testing new compiler features."

msgid "0：不启用<br>1：每次运行都重新编译所有内核"
msgstr "0: Disabled<br>1: Recompile all kernels on every run"

msgid "DISABLE_LLVM_OPT"
msgstr "DISABLE_LLVM_OPT"

msgid "当设置为 1 时，可以禁用 LLVM 编译过程中的优化步骤(make_llir和make_ptx的LLVM优化)。当设置为字符串，解析为要禁用的LLVM优化标志列表。例如使用`DISABLE_LLVM_OPT=\"disable-lsr\"`可禁用循环强度优化（该优化在某些存在寄存器压力的内核中可能导致高达10%的性能波动）。"
msgstr "When set to 1, the optimization steps during LLVM compilation (LLVM optimizations for make_llir and make_ptx) can be disabled. When set to a string, it is parsed as a list of LLVM optimization flags to disable. For example, using `DISABLE_LLVM_OPT=\"disable-lsr\"` can disable loop strength reduction optimization (which may cause performance fluctuations of up to 10% in certain kernels with register pressure)."

msgid "0：LLVM 的优化是启用状态<br>1：禁用 LLVM 编译过程中的优化步骤(make_llir和make_ptx的LLVM优化) <list>:\"disable-lsr\":禁用循环强度优化 </list>"
msgstr "0: LLVM optimizations are enabled<br>1: Disable the optimization steps during LLVM compilation (LLVM optimizations for make_llir and make_ptx) <list>:\"disable-lsr\": Disable loop strength reduction optimization </list>"

msgid "<list>"
msgstr "<list>"

msgid "</list>"
msgstr "</list>"

msgid "MLIR_ENABLE_TIMING"
msgstr "MLIR_ENABLE_TIMING"

msgid "启用或禁用 MLIR 编译过程中的时间统计功能。"
msgstr "Enable or disable the time statistics feature during the MLIR compilation process."

msgid "LLVM_ENABLE_TIMING"
msgstr "LLVM_ENABLE_TIMING"

msgid "启用或禁用 LLVM 编译过程中的时间统计功能。"
msgstr "Enable or disable the time statistics feature during LLVM compilation."

msgid "TRITON_DEFAULT_FP_FUSION"
msgstr "TRITON_DEFAULT_FP_FUSION"

msgid "1 启用"
msgstr "1 Enable"

msgid "控制是否默认启用浮点运算融合优化，覆盖默认的浮点运算融合行为（如mul+add->fma）。"
msgstr "Controls whether floating-point operation fusion optimization is enabled by default, overriding the default floating-point operation fusion behavior (such as mul+add->fma)."

msgid "TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE"
msgstr "TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE"

msgid "启用或禁用 Triton 内核覆盖功能，允许在每个编译阶段开始时用用户指定的外部文件（IR/PTX等）覆盖默认生成的内核代码。"
msgstr "Enable or disable the Triton kernel override feature, allowing user-specified external files (IR/PTX, etc.) to override the default generated kernel code at the beginning of each compilation stage."

msgid "TRITON_OVERRIDE_DIR"
msgstr "TRITON_OVERRIDE_DIR"

msgid "~/.triton/override"
msgstr "~/.triton/override"

msgid "指定 Triton 内核覆盖文件的查找目录。当`TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE=1`时加载IR/PTX文件的目录。"
msgstr "Directory for locating Triton kernel override files. When `TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE=1`, this is the directory from which IR/PTX files are loaded."

msgid "TRITON_COMPILE_ONLY"
msgstr "TRITON_COMPILE_ONLY"

msgid "remote_launch时使用，只编译不运行。"
msgstr "Used when remote_launch is enabled, compile only without running."

msgid "TRITON_DISABLE_PRECOMPILE"
msgstr "TRITON_DISABLE_PRECOMPILE"

msgid "是否禁用预编译。"
msgstr "Whether to disable precompilation."

msgid "0：启用预编译<br>1：禁用预编译"
msgstr "0: Enable precompilation<br>1: Disable precompilation"

msgid "**运行与调度**"
msgstr "**Execution and Scheduling**"

msgid "TRITON_ENABLE_TASKQUEUE"
msgstr "TRITON_ENABLE_TASKQUEUE"

msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

msgid "是否开启task_queue。"
msgstr "Whether to enable task_queue."

msgid "TRITON_ENABLE_SANITIZER"
msgstr "TRITON_ENABLE_SANITIZER"

msgid "是否启用 SANITIZER。"
msgstr "Whether to enable SANITIZER."

msgid "ENABLE_PRINT_UB_BITS"
msgstr "ENABLE_PRINT_UB_BITS"

msgid "打开后可以获取当前UB占用量，给inductor使用。"
msgstr "Once enabled, the current UB usage can be obtained for use by the inductor."

msgid "NPU_DEVICE_LIMIT"
msgstr "NPU_DEVICE_LIMIT"

msgid "用户设置算子运行时最大aicore和vector_core,格式要求：数字以,分割。比如：14,28。"
msgstr "Users set the operator's maximum aicore and vector_core at runtime, with the format requirement: numbers separated by commas. For example: 14,28."

msgid "无默认值"
msgstr "No default value."

msgid "**其他**"
msgstr "**Others**"

msgid "TRITON_BENCH_METHOD"
msgstr "TRITON_BENCH_METHOD"

msgid "使用昇腾NPU时，将`testing.py`中的`do_bench`切换为`do_bench_npu`（需配合`INDUCTOR_ASCEND_AGGRESSIVE_AUTOTUNE = 1`使用）。设为`default`时即使NPU可用，仍调用原`do_bench`函数。"
msgstr "When using Ascend NPU, switch `do_bench` in `testing.py` to `do_bench_npu` (requires `INDUCTOR_ASCEND_AGGRESSIVE_AUTOTUNE = 1`). When set to `default`, the original `do_bench` function is still called even if the NPU is available."

msgid "\"npu\"：切换为`do_bench_npu`"
msgstr "\"npu\": Switch to `do_bench_npu`"

msgid "TRITON_REMOTE_RUN_CONFIG_PATH"
msgstr "TRITON_REMOTE_RUN_CONFIG_PATH"

msgid "path"
msgstr "path"

msgid "指定远程运行的配置路径。"
msgstr "Specify the configuration path for remote execution."

msgid "直接给定path"
msgstr "Directly specify the path."

msgid "编译选项"
msgstr "Compilation options"

msgid "编译选项用于控制单个 Triton kernel 的编译策略，可通过 `triton.Config`、Autotune 参数或 kernel launch meta-parameter 传入。"
msgstr "Compilation options are used to control the compilation strategy of a single Triton kernel and can be passed via `triton.Config`, Autotune parameters, or kernel launch meta-parameters."

msgid "编译选项用法示例"
msgstr "Compilation Option Usage Examples"

msgid "例如，可在 kernel launch 时直接传入 `multibuffer`："
msgstr "For example, you can directly pass `multibuffer` at kernel launch:"

msgid "import torch\\n"
msgstr "import torch"

msgid "编译选项参考表"
msgstr "Compiler Options Reference Table"

msgid "编译选项配置参考下表："
msgstr "Compiler option configuration reference table below:"

msgid "默认值/可选值"
msgstr "Default value / optional value"

msgid "**通用流水**"
msgstr "**General Pipeline**"

msgid "`multibuffer`"
msgstr "`multibuffer`"

msgid "`True`（默认）、`False`"
msgstr "`True` (default), `False`"

msgid "启用或禁用 ping-pong/double buffer 流水。默认开启。"
msgstr "Enable or disable the ping-pong/double buffer pipeline. Enabled by default."

msgid "`triton.Config` 或 launch meta-parameter"
msgstr "`triton.Config` or launch meta-parameter"

msgid "**图优化**"
msgstr "**Graph optimization**"

msgid "`enable_graph_optimize`"
msgstr "`enable_graph_optimize`"

msgid "启用或禁用 TTIR Graph Optimization。具体规则、重写次数和 UB 预算由后端维护。"
msgstr "Enable or disable TTIR Graph Optimization. The backend maintains the specific rules, rewrite counts, and UB budget."

msgid "**毕昇编译器**"
msgstr "**BiSheng compiler**"

msgid "`bisheng_options`"
msgstr "`bisheng_options`"

msgid "后端默认字符串或用户字符串"
msgstr "Backend default string or user string"

msgid "向支持该选项的毕昇编译路径透传附加参数。"
msgstr "Passes additional parameters through to the BiSheng compilation path that supports this option."

msgid "**CV 融合**"
msgstr "**CV Fusion**"

msgid "`enable_auto_bind_sub_block`"
msgstr "enable_auto_bind_sub_block"

msgid "`None`、`True`、`False`"
msgstr "`None`, `True`, `False`"

msgid "启用或禁用自动绑定 sub-block。"
msgstr "Enable or disable automatic binding of sub-blocks."

msgid "`enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance`"
msgstr "`enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance`"

msgid "启用或禁用自动 CV balance。"
msgstr "Enable or disable automatic CV balance."

msgid "`triton.Config` 或 Autotune 参数"
msgstr "`triton.Config` or Autotune parameters"

msgid "`enable_cube_block_merge`"
msgstr "`enable_cube_block_merge`"

msgid "`False`（默认）、`True`"
msgstr "`False` (default), `True`"

msgid "控制 DynamicCV pipeline 的 Cube block merge。"
msgstr "Controls the Cube block merge in the DynamicCV pipeline."

msgid "**VF 融合**"
msgstr "**VF fusion**"

msgid "`vf_fusion_mode`"
msgstr "`vf_fusion_mode`"

msgid "`None`（默认，遵循 BiShengIR 默认值 `\"max-parallel\"`）、`\"max-parallel\"`、`\"all-op\"`、`\"ub-aware-op\"`"
msgstr "`None` (default, follows the BiShengIR default value `\"max-parallel\"`), `\"max-parallel\"`, `\"all-op\"`, `\"ub-aware-op\"`"

msgid "选择 Ascend 950 BiShengIR 阶段的 VF fusion 策略。"
msgstr "Select the VF fusion strategy for the Ascend 950 BiShengIR stage."

msgid "`enable_vf_fusion`"
msgstr "`enable_vf_fusion`"

msgid "`None`（默认，遵循 BiShengIR 默认值 `True`）、`True`、`False`"
msgstr "`None` (default, follows the BiShengIR default value `True`), `True`, `False`"

msgid "控制 Ascend 950 BiShengIR 阶段是否启用 VF fusion。该选项是 VF fusion 的总开关；`vf_fusion_mode` 仅用于选择融合策略。"
msgstr "Controls whether VF fusion is enabled during the Ascend 950 BiShengIR stage. This option is the master switch for VF fusion; `vf_fusion_mode` is only used to select the fusion strategy."

msgid "**HFusion**"
msgstr "**HFusion**"

msgid "`hfusion_enable_multiple_consumer_fusion`"
msgstr "`hfusion_enable_multiple_consumer_fusion`"

msgid "控制 Ascend 950 BiShengIR 阶段的多 consumer 融合。"
msgstr "Controls multi-consumer fusion in the Ascend 950 BiShengIR stage."

msgid "**CV 融合/同步**"
