msgstr "**Compilation Mode**"

msgid "`compile_mode`"
msgstr "`compile_mode`"

msgid "`\"simd_simt_template\"`（默认）、`\"simd\"`、`\"simt_only\"`"
msgstr "`\"simd_simt_template\"` (default), `\"simd\"`, `\"simt_only\"`"

msgid "控制 SIMD / SIMT 编译路径。`\"simd\"`：纯 SIMD；`\"simd_simt_template\"`：普通 SIMD pipeline，并在 Ascend 950 上启用 template-SIMT 子路径；`\"simt_only\"`：仅 Ascend 950 支持的纯 SIMT 路径（`ttir→npubin`）。"
msgstr "Controls the SIMD / SIMT compilation path. `\"simd\"`: pure SIMD; `\"simd_simt_template\"`: standard SIMD pipeline, and enables the template-SIMT sub-path on Ascend 950; `\"simt_only\"`: pure SIMT path supported only on Ascend 950 (`ttir→npubin`)."

msgid "编译选项清理与兼容性"
msgstr "Compilation Option Cleanup and Compatibility"

msgid "环境变量和编译选项参考表仅列出仍然生效的公开控制项。已经删除或转由后端内部维护的旧环境变量和编译选项不再列入参考表。作为临时兼容措施，当前继续传入这些废弃项时，编译器会发出 `FutureWarning` 并忽略用户值，使用后端维护值或默认行为。这些废弃项将在后续版本中按计划彻底删除；废弃编译选项彻底删除后，继续传入将被视为不支持的选项，并导致编译报错。用户应在兼容期内完成迁移。"
msgstr "The environment variable and compilation option reference table lists only the public control items that are still in effect. The reference table no longer lists old environment variables and compilation options that have been deleted or are now maintained internally by the backend. As a temporary compatibility measure, if you continue to pass these deprecated items, the compiler issues a `FutureWarning`. It ignores your values and uses the backend-maintained values or default behavior. These deprecated items will be completely removed in subsequent versions as planned. After deprecated compilation options are completely removed, the compiler will treat them as unsupported options and report compilation errors if you pass them. You should complete the migration within the compatibility period."

msgid "已更名的编译选项"
msgstr "Renamed Compilation Options"

msgid "以下废弃名称仍可在兼容期内传入，编译器会将其路由到当前名称。新代码应直接使用当前名称："
msgstr "The following deprecated names can still be passed in during the compatibility period, and the compiler routes them to the current names. New code should use the current names directly:"

msgid "废弃名称"
msgstr "Deprecated names"

msgid "当前名称或取值"
msgstr "Current name or value"

msgid "兼容行为"
msgstr "Compatibility behavior"

msgid "`force_simt_only`"
msgstr "`force_simt_only`"

msgid "`compile_mode=\"simt_only\"`"
msgstr "`compile_mode=\"simt_only\"`"

msgid "显式传入即发出 `FutureWarning`；旧值为 `True` 时路由并覆盖已传入的 `compile_mode`，为 `False` 时不改变当前模式。"
msgstr "If explicitly passed in, a `FutureWarning` is issued; when the old value is `True`, it routes and overrides the passed-in `compile_mode`, and when the value is `False`, the current mode is not changed."

msgid "`force_simt_template`"
msgstr "`force_simt_template`"

msgid "`compile_mode=\"simd_simt_template\"`"
msgstr "`compile_mode=\"simd_simt_template\"`"

msgid "`intra_cache_num`"
msgstr "`intra_cache_num`"

msgid "发出 `FutureWarning` 后保留原值；同时传入新旧名称时使用新名称。"
msgstr "The original value is retained after a `FutureWarning` is issued; if both the new and old names are passed, the new name is used."

msgid "`inter_cache_num`"
msgstr "`inter_cache_num`"

msgid "`load_cache_num`"
msgstr "`load_cache_num`"

msgid "`compile_mode=\"unstructured_in_simt\"` 当前作为 `compile_mode=\"simd_simt_template\"` 的等价兼容取值接受，并会规范化为当前取值；它当前不会触发 `FutureWarning`。新代码应使用 `simd_simt_template`。"
msgstr "`compile_mode=\"unstructured_in_simt\"` is currently accepted as an equivalent compatible value for `compile_mode=\"simd_simt_template\"` and is normalized to the current value. It currently does not trigger a `FutureWarning`. For new code, use `simd_simt_template`."

msgid "应从用户配置中删除的编译选项"
msgstr "Compilation options to remove from user configuration"

msgid "以下废弃选项没有继续生效的同名公开入口。兼容期内显式传入时，编译器会发出 `FutureWarning` 并忽略用户值；用户应按下表将其从 `triton.Config`、Autotune 配置或 kernel launch meta-parameter 中删除。"
msgstr "The following deprecated options do not have a public entry of the same name that remains in effect. When explicitly passed during the compatibility period, the compiler issues a `FutureWarning` and ignores the user value; you should remove them from `triton.Config`, Autotune configurations, or kernel launch meta-parameter as shown in the table below."

msgid "废弃选项"
msgstr "Deprecated options"

msgid "迁移方式及当前后端行为"
msgstr "Migration method and current backend behavior"

msgid "`add_auto_scheduling`"
msgstr "`add_auto_scheduling`"

msgid "删除该选项；DAG 自动调度开关已移除，无替代项。"
msgstr "This option is removed; the DAG automatic scheduling switch has been removed, and there is no replacement."

msgid "`allow_fp8e4nv`"
msgstr "`allow_fp8e4nv`"

msgid "删除该选项；该字段没有有效 consumer，无替代项。"
msgstr "Remove this option; this field has no valid consumer and no replacement."

msgid "`arch`"
msgstr "`arch`"

msgid "删除该选项；目标架构由编译目标的 `GPUTarget.arch` 提供。"
msgstr "Delete this option; the compilation target's `GPUTarget.arch` provides the target architecture."

