msgstr "This option is removed; tiling and sub-block binding are derived from Linalg IR and lock semantics."

msgid "`code_motion`"
msgstr "`code_motion`"

msgid "删除该选项；原 vendor compiler 控制项已移除，无替代项。"
msgstr "Delete this option; the original vendor compiler control item has been removed, and there is no replacement."

