msgid "已废弃的环境变量"
msgstr "Deprecated environment variables"

msgid "以下环境变量在兼容期内被检测到时会发出 `FutureWarning`，但其值不再影响后端行为。用户应取消设置："
msgstr "The following environment variables trigger a `FutureWarning` when detected during the compatibility period, but their values no longer affect backend behavior. You should unset them:"

msgid "废弃环境变量"
msgstr "Deprecated environment variables"

msgid "`LLVM_ROOT`"
msgstr "`LLVM_ROOT`"

msgid "取消设置；如需选择 CPU launcher 编译器，设置 `CC`。"
msgstr "Leave it unset; if you need to select the CPU launcher compiler, set `CC`."

msgid "`MLIR_ROOT`"
msgstr "`MLIR_ROOT`"

msgid "取消设置；使用随包提供或可从 `PATH` 发现的 MLIR 工具。"
msgstr "Leave it unset; use the MLIR tools provided with the package or discoverable from `PATH`."

msgid "`TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL`"

msgid "取消设置；自动 block mapping 由后端策略管理。"
msgstr "Unset; the backend policy manages automatic block mapping."

msgid "`TRITON_ASCEND_ARCH`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ASCEND_ARCH`"

